// Title: x-perf-compile-03 is not confined to deep call chains: an operator run over a
// call makes each of its nested fork sites re-walk the callee's whole reachable graph.
// 40 functions, each 'f{i-1}(x) + g0(x) + ... + g39(x)' (about 1600 instances, depth 40).
// Command: GRAPHIX_PAR=auto vs GRAPHIX_PAR=off, timeout -s KILL 60 graphix --no-cache --no-fusion <this file>
// Expected: first value at about the same time under auto and off.
// Observed (debug build, HEAD 9445a1d21): auto 0.94 s, off 0.22 s; at depth 25 x 160 terms
// (about 4000 instances) auto 5.4 s, off 0.41 s; depth 20 x 40: auto 0.32 s, off 0.17 s.
sys::exit(sys::time::after_idle(duration:1.ms, 0));
